      removed by the schema collapse; reintroducing any of them adds a
      validation-theater field with no real runtime consumer (sync writes
      `mcpServerConfig`; the user and agent read `name` as a label) and
      forces the parser to either ignore it or fail on it. The schema
      minimum is the schema maximum."
