  against, and the corresponding plan.aide that follows once this
  spec is approved. Confirmed the post-collapse identifier-naming
  sweep already landed in code (`vaultExists` → `brainRootExists`,
  `VAULT_DIRS` → `BRAIN_ROOT_DIRS`) so the Bad-example identifier
  scenario stays as a regression-against-rollback rather than a
  description of current code.
- `.aide/docs/brain-aide.md` — Methodology doc: brain.aide file
  format, frontmatter field semantics, the marker-bounded body
  section vocabulary, the two substitution surfaces (args at
  install time, body sections verbatim at agent and install time),
  and the divergence from intent-spec conventions that makes
